# Generated by hangar: glTF x = -y, y = up, z = forward (nose); origin at the CG.
forward -y
up +z
scale 1.0
# lifting surfaces, right half, root to tip: <kind> then per section its leading edge (body axes from the origin, m) and chord
wing 0.2500 0.3000 0.0000 0.8000 0.0500 3.0000 0.0000 0.4000
# jet engines by index: <bypass ratio> <afterburner 0|1> <dry thrust, kN> <thrust with reheat, kN (0: none)> <fuel a second for each kN, dry and with reheat, g/(kN s)>
engine 0 1.000 0 6.00 0.00 22.660 56.651
